        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on current pain points and prioritise focus areas for the refresh.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 246501,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, let's kick off the 'In-Store Customer Experience and Merchandising Refresh' project. To start, what are the biggest issues you're seeing on the floor? Think about common customer questions, complaints, or things that make our jobs harder with the current displays. Let's get it all out here.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "wave",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 427273,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Good start. For me, it's customers not being able to find sizes, especially in the denim section. And the constant questions about our return policy at the till, it really slows down the queue.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_plus_sign",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 486724,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "I agree with the returns policy point. Also, people ask about stock for items that are on display but we don't have any more of. It creates a bad experience when we have to say no.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "point_up",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 177366,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "A lot of people ask for help with the electronics, like how they work. We don't have much info on the shelves for them. That's probably one of the top things I get asked.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 244639,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "the shelves get messy fast. especially the t-shirt tables.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 246501,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "That's a great point about the electronics. It links directly to task T8, identifying products that need clearer info. I've started a sheet to log all these issues, let's use A1 for this. Please add anything else you can think of there.",
            "mentions": [
              177366
