              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 246501,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Excellent, thanks. Looking at the list in A1, three themes are emerging as the most frequent: 1) Confusion over product info/specs (especially electronics), 2) Difficulty finding sizes or stock, and 3) Unclear returns/exchange process. Does everyone agree these are our top 3 pain points to tackle first?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
